    description: "A three-ingredient Roman pasta where finely grated pecorino romano, freshly cracked black pepper, and the starchy water from the pasta are whipped into a glossy, clinging sauce. There is no butter, no cream, no garlic, no olive oil — the whole dish is technique.",
    yield: { quantity: 4, unit: "servings", raw: "4 servings" },
    times: { prepMinutes: 5, cookMinutes: 15, totalMinutes: 20 },
