    description: "An everyday American chili built on browned ground beef, a paste of toasted dried chilies, tomato, beans, cumin, and oregano. A long, lazy simmer concentrates the flavours; the pot tastes better the next day. Serve with the standard battery of cheese, sour cream, lime, and onion.",
